`我们可以灵活运用，将时间戳改为版本号、tag等`

```javascript
const Version = new Date()
  .getTime()
  .toString()
  .match(/.*(.{8})/)[1];
module.exports = {
  publicPath: "./",
  //   更改js文件
  configureWebpack: {
    output: {
      filename: `js/[name].${Version}.js`,
      chunkFilename: `js/[name].${Version}.js`,
    },
  },
  //   更改css文件
  css: {
    extract: {
      filename: `static/css/[name].${Version}.css`,
      chunkFilename: `static/css/[name].${Version}.css`,
    },
  },
};
```

